          "text": "⟪ወኅዳጣን ኅሩያን፡⟫ የተጠ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 33,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ሩ የተመረጡ ጥቂት ናቸው",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 34,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ና ፤ እሥሩ እደዊሁ ወእገሪሁ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 35,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "በል ። አንድም ትመስል መን",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 36,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ግሥተ ሰማያት ብለህ መልስ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 37,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "መንግሥተ ሰማይ አብ ለልጁ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 38,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ሥጋዌን ያደረገ ንጉሥን ይ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 39,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "መስላል ማለት እሱ ነው ። ወ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 40,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ፈነወ አግብርቲሁ፥ትንቢት የ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "column_index": 3,
      "lines": [
        {
          "line_num": 1,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ተነገረላቸውን በኦሪት ፥ ተስፋ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 2,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "መስቀል የተነገረላቸውን በወ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 3,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ንጌል ያሳምኑ ዘንድ አስተም",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 4,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ሩ ብሎ ዓበይተ ነቢያትን ሐዋ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 5,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ርያትን ላከ ። ወዓበዩ ፡ አናምን",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 6,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ም አሉ ። ወዳግመ ፈነወ ካል",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 7,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ዓነ አግብርተ ፡ ለዓበይተ ነቢያ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 8,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ት ካልዓን የሚሆኑ ደቂቀ ነቢ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 9,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ያትን ለሐዋርያት ካልዓን የሚ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 10,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ሆኑ ፸ አርድእትን ፡ ትንቢት",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 11,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "የተነገረላቸውን በኦሪት፥ ተስፋ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 12,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "መስቀል የተነገረላቸውን በወ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 13,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ንጌል አሳምኑ ብሎ ላከ። ናሁ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 14,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ምሳሀየ አስተዳሎኩ ፡ ኦሪትን",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 15,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ወንጌልን ሠርቻለሁ ፤ ወኵሎ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 16,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ድልው ፡ በኦሪት በወንጌል ጥ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 17,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ቃቅኑ ደጋጉ ታምራት ይደረ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 18,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ጋል ። ንዑ ውስተ ከብካብየ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 19,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "በኦሪት በወንጌል እመኑ ብላ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 20,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ችሁ አስተምሩ ብሎ ላካቸው",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 21,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ወእሙንቱሰ ተሐየዩ ፡ እሳቸው",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 22,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ግን ቸል ብለው ሂደው ቦ ዘ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 23,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ሖረ ውስተ ገራህቱ ፡ እርሻች",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 24,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ሁን ተዉ የምትል ሕግ አን",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 25,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ሻም ብሎ ወደ እርሻው የሄ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 26,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ደ አለ ። ቦ ዘሖረ ውስተ ተ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 27,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ግባሩ ፥ ንግዳችሁን ተዉ የም",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 28,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ትል ሕግ አንሻም ብሎ ወደ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 29,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ንግዱ የሄደ አለ ። ወቦ ዘሖረ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 30,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ውስተ ዓፀደ ወይኑ፤ወይናችሁ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 31,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ን ተዉ የምትል ሕግ አንሻም",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 32,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ብሎ ወደወይን ጥበቃው የሄደ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 33,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "አለ የቀሩት ግን ዓበይተ ነቢያ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 34,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ትን ደቂቀ ነቢያትን ሐዋርያት",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 35,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ን ፸ አርድእትን ይዘው ገደሏቸ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 36,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ው ወኪያሁኒ ጸዓሉ ። እሱንም",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 37,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "እሩቅ ብእሲ አሉት ። ወተም",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 38,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ዓ ንጉሥ ፡ ጌታ ፈርዶ ነቢያት",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 39,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ን በገደሉ ነገሥተ ፋርስን፥ሐዋ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 40,
          "margin_tag": null,
